The gate is the full pair, both rungs being Java: disk; `ant compileAll`; the library rebuild plus the cache copy for the ladder stage; `ant testFast` and `ant testSystem` with zero failures and zero errors in every suite; the summary against the last landed o

Provenance. Workers commit to their `wip/` branch by an explicit list of files and read `git diff --cached --stat` before each commit; evidence enters `main` at the gather by an explicit list too, never by a directory. Each REPORT.md opens with the five-line p

